card.statement:
Let $\lambda_2$ be a dominant coweight and consider the multiplication map for the point $\Wu^{\lambda_2}_{\lambda_2}=\{t^{\mu_2}\} \times \bb A^1$, $\Wu^{\lambda_1}_{\mu_1}\times_{\bb A^1} \Wu^{\lambda_2}_{\lambda_2} \rightarrow \Wu^{\lambda_1+\lambda_2}_{\mu_1+\mu_2}$. This gives rise to a shift map,

\begin{equation}
\iota_{\mu_2}:\Wu^{\lambda_1}_{\mu_1}\hookrightarrow \Wu^{\lambda_1+\lambda_2}_{\mu_1+\mu_2}~.
\end{equation}

which is a Poisson, open immersion.
